From u267c7c6c510dc8a2 at groups.google.com  Wed Aug 12 22:23:47 2009
From: u267c7c6c510dc8a2 at groups.google.com (Ian Fellows)
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2009 22:23:47 +0000
Subject: Re: Why Deducer
Message-ID: <wPNkuX3fOeI.tZgwXcLbl9EJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
